            <ArticleTitle>Physical therapy for pelvic floor dysfunction.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>10-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article has summarized the assessment of a woman with pelvic floor muscle dysfunction or pain complaints and has briefly described the interventions used to treat women with these concerns. The American Physical Therapy Association explains: &quot;As a woman in today's world, you enjoy a life of many choices. The choices we make will determine the way we use our body through the decades. A physical therapist will be there for you as you progress through all stages of your life.&quot;</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
